The grooved solitaire is the quietest men's diamond ring on the market. The band does the talking — parallel grooves run the length of the shank. The 2ct stone sits at the top. It is not a showpiece. It is a deliberate finishing detail on a masculine band.

Best for: you if you want maximum carat weight without the ring reading as jewelry.

