### Setting Type 2 — Channel Set (Complete Band, No Center Stone Needed)

Channel-set men's rings have diamonds already set across the band top in a flush channel. No center stone required. If you want diamond presence without committing $16,490+ to a single stone, this is the correct path.

The tradeoff: no single focal stone. The diamond weight is distributed across the band.

