### Setting Type 3 — Pavé Edge (Stone + Band Diamonds)

Pavé edge settings have small diamonds set along the edges of the band. There is an open center head for your 2ct stone. You get diamond presence on the stone and the band simultaneously.

This is the most diamond-intensive look in a men's 2ct ring.

